  "note": "Round 29, rehearsed on the Blueback table, lane by the desk, the first batch on the kit that lists a vision or audio tower the export left out: Pranavz's Hearthfire, a text-only save of a Mistral Small 3.2 heretic edit (vision tower and projector gone), and minpeter's text-only Voxtral Mini 3B heretic (audio tower gone), both held from earlier rounds for that reason; beside them akpsahan's upload of the huihui 31B v2 edit, claymorecrystal's 26B-A4B, three E4B copies of the instruct model (NullpoLab, alphakek, senjiangchen) and Felldude's copy of the pretrained E4B. Held: TurkishCodeMan E2B, an export with 18 layers against the original's 35, not a copy of that model; sitten1 26B-A4B for room; OS-Software and TheUmbraWalker E4B, named after the instruct model but carded to the pretrained base, to be pinned against the instruct model."
